{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is B-connected to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":", or some hyperedge with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" among its targets is entered along a path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" is a vertex."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Precondition"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF","modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L318"},"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"b_visit"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/GraphProtocols/DirectedHypergraph":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedHypergraph","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph","title":"DirectedHypergraph","fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP","text":"DirectedHypergraph","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/GraphProtocols":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols","role":"colle